    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43290" root="لزم" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَازِمٌ</span></b>  <i>Keeping, keeping close, cleaving,</i> &amp;c.;
<i>tenacious:</i> and <i>pertinacious.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَازِمٌ</span> <i>A thing inseparable from another thing:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوَازِمُ</span>. (TA.)
<i>Such as cleaves fast; inseparable:</i> as an epthet.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسْمٌ لَازِمٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمْعٌ</span>, as signifying “ a plural. ”
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوَازِمُ</span> <i>Necessary,</i> or <i>inseparable, adjuncts,
accompaniments, consequences,</i> or <i>results.</i>

